# Real tender documents — business-sensitive, kept local only (docs/DECISIONS.md #27).
# The synthetic eval fixtures under backend/evals/fixtures/ are unaffected (not PDFs
# matched by this pattern's directory scope).
documents/*.pdf

# Real company_profiles seed data — real financial figures/client names for a real
# company (docs/DECISIONS.md #51), same reasoning as the tender PDFs above: business-
# sensitive, kept local + in the real (non-public) Postgres only, repo is public.
backend/scripts/seed_data/

# Real C4i4 statutory documents (PAN/GST/MOA/AOA/Udyam scans) and the company's
# corrected statutory profile writeup — same reasoning as the seed data above: real,
# sensitive documents for a real company, repo is public. The PQ/TQ framework
# spreadsheet is excluded too (treated as sensitive by explicit choice, even though it
# appeared to be a blank template — safer default for a public repo).
docs/C4i4_company_docs/
docs/sutf-company-profile-decision-grade.docx
docs/C4i4_Tender_PQ_TQ_BID_NO_BID_Framework*.xlsx

# Local pipeline test output (scripts/local_pipeline_test.py) — real extracted tender
# text and real go_no_go analysis referencing the real company profile, same
# reasoning as above.
backend/scripts/local_pipeline_test_output/

